# What the counter looks like, compared with its goldens, and a count a
# relaunch loses. The goldens (flows/__screenshots__/<platform>) were
# recorded on an iPhone 18 Pro simulator, a Pixel emulator (portrait),
# headless Chrome and a Mac, and on Linux in CI's image: on another device,
# asuka test --gui --update records its own.
expect screenshot start
tap Add
tap Add
assert enabled Reset
expect screenshot two mask Count: *
background
foreground
see Count: 2
relaunch
see Count: 0
